Lua runtime
===========

Lua 5.0.2 — Copyright (C) 2003-2004 Tecgraf, PUC-Rio.
MIT license; full upstream notice: docs/licenses/Lua-5.0.2-COPYRIGHT.
Source: https://www.lua.org/ftp/lua-5.0.2.tar.gz

The build fetches the SHA256-pinned source archive through cmake/Lua502.cmake.
cmake/PatchLua502.cmake applies three host-compatibility changes: two nullable
union-member address expressions become direct pointer casts, and pointer
hashing narrows explicitly through uintptr_t. The upstream copyright and
license remain unchanged. Include its notice when distributing linked binaries.

